  One pre-existing asymmetry I did not change: ei_core.generate_text_sections calls Claude directly and raises ClaudeExtractionError if it's unreachable,
  while the new RS/DEG generators fall back to deterministic prose. A test asserts the EI behaviour so a future change to it is visible rather than silent.
